# Module Section Tabs

Peer views inside a Team Operations (or similar) module use the shared
`ModuleSectionTabs` primitive (`src/components/ModuleSectionTabs.tsx`), which
matches Practice section tabs exactly.

## Use for

- True peer views / Adaptive Workspace surfaces (e.g. Opponent Players | Teams |
  Match Reports | Form Submissions; Daily Plan | Drill Library | …)

## Do NOT use for

- Badges, filters, lifecycle Active|Archived toggles, quick views, tags, or
  action chips — those keep filter/select patterns, not peer tabs.

## Rules

- Prefer importing `ModuleSectionTabs` over inventing rounded-full pill nav.
- Do not change Practice tab appearance when adopting the shared component.
- Active state: `bg-[var(--module-accent)] text-white` on `rounded-control`
  inside a `rounded-card` tray — never `rounded-full` filled capsules for peer
  views.
